# Claude Code agent worktrees. One of these was committed as a GITLINK whose pointer
# file resolves into a DIFFERENT repository on this machine, so git could never read it
# and the entry sat permanently modified in `git status`. The directory itself belongs to
# that other repo's worktree and is deliberately left on disk; it is only untracked here.
.claude/worktrees/

